# Attribution

`herdr-agent-state.sh` is the Claude Code integration hook generated by `herdr integration install claude` (Herdr 0.9.1, integration version 10), committed unchanged. It is registered in [settings.json](../settings.json) with a `$HOME`-relative path instead of the absolute path Herdr writes.

